@page "/configuration/instructions/orgchart"
@layout SidebarLayout

<PageTitle>Org Chart Options and Instructions</PageTitle>

<ilw-content>
    <h1>Organizational Chart Options and Instructions</h1>
    <p>Organizational Charts are a visual representation of the structure of an organization, showing the relationships and relative ranks of its parts and positions/jobs. Unlike the other types of items (People, Publications, Resources, etc.), this is a custom edit option and items are tied to each other. Also, you can only have one Organizational Chart per source.</p>
</ilw-content>

<InstructionList CategoryType="CategoryType.OrgChart"></InstructionList>